			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Verr Goldet"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10030401,
					"content": "Tell me about that adeptus",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030402
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10030402,
					"content": "Oh? You've already met Xiao?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030403,
					"content": "Not bad. Not often he's in a good enough mood to agree to see people.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030404,
					"content": "That's his good mood?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030405,
					"content": "Oh yes, the adepti are very hard to come by. Many people go their whole lives praying to them, never once actually getting to see one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030406,
					"content": "When the Geo Archon built Liyue, he borrowed power from the adepti.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030407,
					"content": "But most of them only know how to protect Liyue by fighting.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030408,
					"content": "So for many millennia, it has instead been humans who have led Liyue, whilst the adepti have lived hidden away on the outskirts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030409,
					"content": "You really know a lot, huh boss lady.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030410,
					"content": "It's not \"boss lady,\" it's just boss...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030411,
					"content": "Anyway, seen as you have the favor of the adepti, things should be a lot easier.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030412,
					"content": "Well... If you wanna know my opinion... If you keep Xiao in a good mood, things should be okay.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030413,
					"content": "Good mood? Can't really imagine what a \"good mood\" looks like for that \"Vigilant Yaksha.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030414,
					"content": "Haha! Will be interesting, won't it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030415,
					"content": "(Come to think of it, I've never seen him smile either...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030416,
					"content": "How 'bout this — you go see the chef for a bowl of Almond Tofu, and a plate of whatever it is you are best at making.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030417,
					"content": "Almond Tofu is one of the few human foods Xiao likes. The other dish is up to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verr Goldet"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030418,
					"content": "#Up to us, eh...? {NICKNAME}, what do you think you're the best at cooking?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030419,
						10030421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030419,
					"content": "Satisfying Salad I guess?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030420
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10030420,
					"content": "Really hard to screw that one up, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030423,
					"content": "But, if we're gonna be cooking for an adeptus, perhaps the Satisfying Salad would be the safer choice...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030421,
					"content": "Perhaps a Maha Manjusaka Hot Pyro Slime?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030422
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10030422,
					"content": "Wow! Never heard of that one! Paimon wants to try it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
